# Keep this file value-free. Configure real values in Sites > Settings > Environment.
#
# D1 is bound as DB through .openai/hosting.json; it is not an environment
# variable and must never be replaced with a connection string.
#
# Add only a server-side teaching-provider credential if the /api/explain route
# is ported. Do not prefix secrets with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_MODEL=
